# Architecture

Read `architecture/MASTER_ARCHITECTURE.md`, then `architecture/MODULE_REGISTRY.md`, before structural changes.

- Check **Registry coverage status**; read `architecture/modules/<id>/` when `AUTHORITY_ACTIVE`.
- `SYSTEM_OVERVIEW.md` remains the logical system description; do not duplicate module detail in PR prose.
- Document substantive cross-cutting decisions in `architecture/decisions/`.
- Substantive changes: update module `CHANGE_LEDGER.md`, `CURRENT_STATE.md`, and registry metadata when applicable.
- VYMOD is consumer-facing; Core interfaces are versioned (`architecture/integrations/`).
- No live DIMO/SYNQDRIVE wiring without separate authorization.

Owners in MODULE_REGISTRY must approve boundary changes.
